---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import ServiceCards from "../components/ServiceCards.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Planned beekeeping for home and farm"
  description="Explore The True Hive's planned colony-removal and farm-pollination paths. Services need assessment, confirmed scope, and capacity; booking is not open."
>
  <section
    class="wrap services-page-intro"
    aria-labelledby="services-page-title"
  >
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Beekeeping / Beyond the collection</p>
      <h1 id="services-page-title">
        For the bees.
        <br />
        <em>And the neighbors.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="services-page-lede">
        A home and a growing field have different needs. Both deserve a careful
        conversation before any work is agreed.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="#service-paths">
        Explore the planned paths <span aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <aside class="services-page-note" aria-label="Service planning status">
      <p class="eyebrow">Before anything is agreed</p>
      <p class="services-page-note-title">
        A conversation.
        <br />
        An assessment.
        <br />
        <em>Then a decision.</em>
      </p>
      <p>
        These services are planned, not bookable. Scope, capability, coverage,
        and capacity must be confirmed individually.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section
    id="service-paths"
    class="services-page-paths"
    aria-labelledby="services-page-paths-title"
  >
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="services-page-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Two directions / No instant booking</p>
        <h2 id="services-page-paths-title">
          Different settings.
          <br />
          The same careful start.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <ServiceCards detailed />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section
    class="wrap services-page-process"
    aria-labelledby="services-page-process-title"
  >
    <div class="services-page-process-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">If services become available</p>
      <h2 id="services-page-process-title">A useful first conversation.</h2>
      <p>
        An inquiry would begin with understanding the situation, not a payment
        or a promise. Here is what that process would need to establish.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol class="services-page-steps">
      <li>
        <span aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Understand the setting</h3>
          <p>
            Describe the property or crop and the general situation. Do not
            approach bees or disturb a colony to gather more information.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Check the fit</h3>
          <p>
            The proposed work would need an assessment of access, scope,
            capability, timing, and capacity. An inquiry is not an agreement.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Agree before proceeding</h3>
          <p>
            Any work, responsibilities, and arrangements would need explicit
            agreement first. A request may be outside the available scope.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section
    class="wrap services-page-ending"
    aria-labelledby="services-page-ending-title"
  >
    <div class="services-page-ending-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">
          Keep a little distance. Start with a conversation.
        </p>
        <h2 id="services-page-ending-title">
          The next step,
          <br />
          <em>when it's ready.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="services-page-ending-copy">
        <p>
          Check our contact section for confirmed phone and profile links, or an
          honest update if they are not published yet. There is no online
          booking, message form, or emergency response channel here.
        </p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/#connect">
          Check our contact channels <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .services-page-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
  }
  .services-page-intro h1 {
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.8vw, 5.75rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }
  .services-page-intro h1 em {
    letter-spacing: inherit;
  }
  .services-page-lede {
    max-width: 32rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .services-page-intro .text-link {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .services-page-note {
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--forest);
    background: var(--ochre);
  }
  .services-page-note > .eyebrow {
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--forest);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
  }
  .services-page-note-title {
    margin-block: 1.75rem;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.8vw, 2.6rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .services-page-note > p:last-child {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }
  .services-page-paths {
    padding-block: 4.5rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #eee9dc;
  }
  .services-page-heading {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .services-page-heading h2 {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }
  .services-page-process {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: 3rem 5rem;
    padding-block: 5.5rem;
  }
  .services-page-process-intro h2 {
    margin-block: 1rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 3.8vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }
  .services-page-process-intro > p:last-child {
    max-width: 30rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .services-page-steps {
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .services-page-steps li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .services-page-steps li:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }
  .services-page-steps li > span {
    color: var(--tomato);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .services-page-steps h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.65rem;
  }
  .services-page-steps p {
    max-width: 31rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .services-page-ending {
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  .services-page-ending-panel {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--forest);
  }
  .services-page-ending h2 {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .services-page-ending h2 em {
    color: var(--tomato);
  }
  .services-page-ending-copy > p {
    max-width: 31rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .services-page-ending-copy .button {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 56rem) {
    .services-page-intro {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .services-page-intro > div {
      max-width: 42rem;
    }
    .services-page-note {
      max-width: 36rem;
    }
    .services-page-process {
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .services-page-ending-panel {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .services-page-intro,
    .services-page-paths,
    .services-page-process {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }
    .services-page-intro h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 9.5vw, 4rem);
    }
    .services-page-process,
    .services-page-ending-panel {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .services-page-ending {
      padding-bottom: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
